$ graphify install --project --platform copilot
  references       ->  .copilot/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .copilot/skills/graphify/SKILL.md

Project-scoped install. Add to version control:
  git add .copilot/

$ graphify copilot install
  references       ->  <FIXTURE_ROOT>/home/.copilot/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  <FIXTURE_ROOT>/home/.copilot/skills/graphify/SKILL.md

Done. Open your AI coding assistant and type:

  /graphify .

